{
  "_doc": "Hand-designed pixel grids stamped on clip frames by tools/build_sprite.py before mirroring. '.' keeps the pixel underneath, '_' erases it. anchor 'head' centres the grid on the detected head top; dx/dy nudge it; per_frame adds per-frame nudges. Templates face right (or front); left frames are mirrored copies. clear: [rows, margin] erases old pixels up to `margin` px beside the template's first `rows` rows and above it.",
